00:28:36.181 --> 00:28:37.914
- Yes.
- Wow. Good for you.


00:28:37.916 --> 00:28:39.916
We're done.


00:28:39.918 --> 00:28:41.518
No...


00:28:41.520 --> 00:28:44.854
Mr. Brock, please...
Please listen to me.


00:28:44.856 --> 00:28:46.923
Everything that you
accused him of,


00:28:46.925 --> 00:28:48.258
