Like, aliens?


00:34:16.466 --> 00:34:17.832
E.T. phone home.


00:34:17.834 --> 00:34:19.567
Aliens, yeah.


00:34:19.569 --> 00:34:21.871
Yes.


00:34:22.104 --> 00:34:23.305
But we don't
call them that.


